-- ============================================================
-- AUREUM — Fiscalisation v3: African country catalogue + the fiscal-connector device (ADDITIVE migration)
-- Run AFTER supabase/fiscalisation-v2.sql. Safe to re-run. Touches no existing AUREUM data and approves NOTHING.
--
-- * One country row per African country (status 'in_development'), so the AUREUM team can move each through
--   testing -> approved in the platform admin (Fiscalisation tab) once it has been tested with that authority.
--   Shop owners only ever SEE approved rows, so adding these rows changes nothing for them until then.
-- * One device row, 'local-connector' (any manufacturer, via a fiscal connector), listing the countries it may be used in.
-- * Zimbabwe keeps its own rows from fiscalisation-v2.sql and is also covered by the connector device below.
-- Nothing here is "approved": the gate in fiscal_integrations (documentation verified + approval reference) still applies.
-- ============================================================

